    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "# 02 \u2014 Krea Main Image Generator (high volume)\n\nYour day-to-day generator. Set **project** once (Load Character + both Save nodes), fill in the Prompt Builder's scene/action/clothing/environment/camera/lighting fields, pick an aspect ratio on the Krea node, and Queue. Queue multiple times (or copy the Krea+Save pair) for more candidates from the same prompt with different seeds.\n\n**Aspect ratios**: set on the Krea 2 node's `model.aspect_ratio` widget \u2014 1:1, 4:5, 9:16 and 16:9 are all supported directly.\n\n**Pose / composition / scene references** (optional, bottom-left): chain up to 10 Krea 2 Style Reference nodes into the main node's `style_reference` input. Style reference steers composition/style \u2014 it is not a hard pose-transfer control, since Krea 2's official API has no separate ControlNet-style pose input; document this if precise pose matching turns out to matter more than style influence.\n\nThis workflow only calls Krea (cheap, ~$0.06/image on Large). GPT refinement and video are separate workflows so you don't pay for them by accident."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
